  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/felnut/portfolio-website">FELNUT 포트폴리오 공개 소스</a> —
      src/pages/index.astro, src/layouts/Layout.astro, src/React/EmailLink.tsx, astro.config.mjs,
      package.json
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/concepts/islands/">
